      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree b797a27b2029abb675dd899ebd11c53a8dde3acc\nparent a527a0077a0fcae913188410214efe98021c0cca\nauthor Jaromil <jaromil@dyne.org> 1794669183 +0100\ncommitter Jaromil <jaromil@dyne.org> 1794676239 +0100\n\nci: Share qa-assets across GitHub Actions jobs\n\nAcquire qa-assets once per workflow run and distribute verified unit\nvectors and fuzz inputs through same-run artifacts. Reuse the common\nhelper for Linux, macOS and Windows consumers instead of downloading the\nsame inputs in each job.\n\nPackage the inputs as tar files so the artifact downloader extracts one\nfile instead of many small corpus files. Let artifact ZIP compression\nhandle the transfer and extract the tar before verification.\n\nRecord the selected revision and file hashes, mount shared inputs\nread-only in containers, and give fuzz jobs separate writable copies.\nKeep standalone acquisition and select a fresh snapshot each run.\n\nRefs https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues/36814.\n",
